WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.568 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Last week, during
a Coronavirus Task Force

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:03.136 line:92%
briefing at the White House,

00:00:03.136 --> 00:00:05.705 align:start size:94% position:6%
the U.S. surgeon general,
Jerome Adams,

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:09.175 align:start size:94% position:6%
revealed that the coronaviru
is disproportionately

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:11.244 align:start size:94% position:6%
affecting Black
and Hispanic Americans

00:00:11.244 --> 00:00:13.480 align:start size:94% position:6%
and, to fix that, Adams said
people of color need

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:16.516 align:start size:94% position:6%
to "Step up
and take responsibility

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:18.084 line:92%
for keeping themselves healthy."

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:19.652 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
He added...

00:00:26.793 --> 00:00:28.395 size:88% position:44%
Here, with more on that,
is one of our writers,

00:00:28.395 --> 00:00:30.130 align:start size:94% position:6%
Amber Ruffin,
with a segment called

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:31.731 line:92%
"Amber's Minute of Fury."

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:34.968 line:92%
[ Heavy metal theme plays

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:37.103 size:75% position:38% line:92%
[ Flames crackling ]

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:37.604 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Fool,

00:00:37.604 --> 00:00:39.039 align:start size:94% position:6%
I know you did not just
get up in front

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:41.207 align:start size:94% position:6%
of your little white friends
and blame the spread

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:43.576 align:start size:94% position:6%
of the coronavirus
on minorities.

00:00:43.576 --> 00:00:44.210 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Damn!

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:46.679 align:start size:94% position:6%
There is nothing
this administration won't blam

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:47.447 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
on people of color.

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:49.382 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm surprised they didn't give
a press conference

00:00:49.382 --> 00:00:50.884 align:start size:94% position:6%
on Easter
to point out the fact that

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:52.352 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ changes accent ]
the worst jelly beans

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:53.420 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
are the Black ones.

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.588 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now, I can see this type
of thing coming

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:56.790 line:92%
from a member of Trump's staff

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:59.793 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I did not see it comin
from a Jerome.

00:00:59.793 --> 00:01:02.395 size:84% position:42% line:92%
A Chad; a Tyler, maybe.

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:05.198 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
But a Jerome?

00:01:05.198 --> 00:01:06.199 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You friggin' idiot.

00:01:06.199 --> 00:01:10.203
You are parroting classic
right-wing talking points.

00:01:10.203 --> 00:01:12.939
If Billboard had a chart
for racist talking points,

00:01:12.939 --> 00:01:15.008 size:88% position:44%
"Minorities just don't
take care of themselves"

00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:18.478
would be number 2, right after
"Never talk about the real roo

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:20.480 align:start size:94% position:6%
of the problem --
systemic racism."

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:23.116
Tsk. Y'all, this man went
on national television,

00:01:23.116 --> 00:01:25.785 size:81% position:41%
flanked by the world's
most famous racists,

00:01:25.785 --> 00:01:28.888 align:start size:94% position:6%
and tried to get minoritie
to stop the spread by saying..

00:01:28.888 --> 00:01:30.390 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ As Adams ]
Do it for your abuela.

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:31.091 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Do it for Big Mama.

00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:33.793
Now, when he was talking
to white people about it,

00:01:33.793 --> 00:01:35.361 line:92%
did he say, "Do it for Pee-Paw"?

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:36.830 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did he say,
"Do it for Gam-Gams"?

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:39.432 size:88% position:44%
No! Because you can talk
to white people regular,

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:40.233 line:92%
but when you talk to minorities,

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:43.837
you have to do an impersonation,
or we can't understand you

00:01:43.837 --> 00:01:45.171 size:84% position:42% line:92%
And reporters are like,

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:47.841
"Black people are getting
sicker than white people.

00:01:47.841 --> 00:01:50.176 line:92%
Mm, anyway, on to sports."

00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:51.444 size:81% position:41% line:92%
But you can't do that!

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:53.980 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause there are
no sports anymore, but also,

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:56.249 size:88% position:44%
if you want to point out
a disparity like that,

00:01:56.249 --> 00:01:58.585 line:92%
you have to say what caused it

00:01:58.585 --> 00:02:01.221 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's redlining.
It's doctor bias.

00:02:01.221 --> 00:02:02.255 size:78% position:39% line:92%
It's systemic racism!

00:02:02.255 --> 00:02:04.791 size:84% position:42%
And, if you don't know
what those things mean,

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:06.059 size:84% position:42% line:92%
it's probably also you!

00:02:06.059 --> 00:02:09.662 align:start size:94% position:6%
America is set up specifically
to do this to Black people

00:02:09.662 --> 00:02:11.297 align:start size:94% position:6%
Bad things always affect
Black people worse

00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:14.367 align:start size:94% position:6%
and Americans always act
like it's Black people's fault

00:02:14.367 --> 00:02:16.736
If Nancy Kerrigan was Black,
people would've been like...

00:02:16.736 --> 00:02:19.606 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ changes accent ]
Well, why were you
in that pipe's way?

00:02:19.606 --> 00:02:22.008 size:81% position:41%
Also, if you're gonna
hang out in this rink,

00:02:22.008 --> 00:02:23.510 line:92%
you need to buy something.

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:27.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
Bad things always affect u
disproportionately.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:27.714 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Except sunburns.

00:02:27.714 --> 00:02:30.984 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now, if it was only
Black people who got sunburns,

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:32.385 line:92%
sunblock would not exist.

00:02:32.385 --> 00:02:34.220 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, it would,
but you wouldn't be able

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:35.421 line:92%
to get it at like Walgreens.

00:02:35.421 --> 00:02:36.489 line:92%
You'd only be able to get it

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:37.924 line:92%
at like a Lee's Beauty Supply,

00:02:37.924 --> 00:02:40.393 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is fine, 'cause I wa
going there, anyway.

00:02:40.393 --> 00:02:41.628 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Now, the coronavirus is

00:02:41.628 --> 00:02:43.596 align:start size:94% position:6%
affecting Black people
disproportionately.

00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:46.633 align:start size:94% position:6%
That is a fact,
but here's the thing, Jerome

00:02:46.633 --> 00:02:48.968 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can't run around sayin
that fact out loud

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:50.503 align:start size:94% position:6%
because we want
the government to fix it!

00:02:50.503 --> 00:02:54.340 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, if you tell Americans
it mostly affects Black people

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:56.943 align:start size:94% position:6%
folks will be
outside in a big pile,

00:02:56.943 --> 00:02:59.245
French kissing strangers
[ Striking palm ] tomorrow

00:02:59.245 --> 00:03:01.514 align:start size:94% position:6%
No one would care!
You need to tell people

00:03:01.514 --> 00:03:04.751 align:start size:94% position:6%
this coronavirus
only affects old white men

00:03:04.751 --> 00:03:05.818 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
and white children.

00:03:05.818 --> 00:03:07.320 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's how you get people
to care.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:09.189 align:start size:94% position:6%
We should be calling this
the J. Crew virus.

00:03:09.189 --> 00:03:11.624 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ changes accent ]
"The J. Crew virus --
Is it serious?"

00:03:11.624 --> 00:03:13.393 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, you can only get it
if you've been

00:03:13.393 --> 00:03:14.894 line:92%
in a J. Crew the past year

00:03:14.894 --> 00:03:16.262 line:92%
"[ Gasp ] The past year?!

00:03:16.262 --> 00:03:17.530 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I go every day!

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:20.133 line:92%
They're my emergency contact!"

00:03:20.133 --> 00:03:20.833 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Now, here's the deal.

00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:23.436 align:start size:94% position:6%
When you have a job that allow
you to work from home,

00:03:23.436 --> 00:03:24.504 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
you can stay home.

00:03:24.504 --> 00:03:25.738 line:92%
It just so happens that the jobs

00:03:25.738 --> 00:03:27.006 align:start size:94% position:6%
that have been deemed
essential --

00:03:27.006 --> 00:03:30.276 align:start size:94% position:6%
healthcare providers,
bus drivers, subway operators,

00:03:30.276 --> 00:03:30.977 size:84% position:42% line:92%
food delivery people --

00:03:30.977 --> 00:03:33.213 align:start size:94% position:6%
a lot of these jobs are done
by Black people,

00:03:33.213 --> 00:03:35.281 align:start size:94% position:6%
and that's messed up,
in several ways,

00:03:35.281 --> 00:03:36.049 size:84% position:42% line:92%
but I'll just say this.

00:03:36.049 --> 00:03:39.018 align:start size:94% position:6%
Minorities are dying so people
can eat Domino's Pizza

00:03:39.018 --> 00:03:41.054 align:start size:94% position:6%
in their pajamas.
That's effed up!

00:03:41.054 --> 00:03:42.789 line:92%
In part, because Pizza Hut

00:03:42.789 --> 00:03:43.690 size:78% position:39% line:92%
is infinitely better.

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:46.926
I'm right, and I don't have time
to argue with you about it

00:03:46.926 --> 00:03:47.760 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
People are dying.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:48.561 line:92%
Now, I'm working from home

00:03:48.561 --> 00:03:52.298
but almost every Black perso
I know is at work right now,

00:03:52.298 --> 00:03:54.100 line:92%
talking about how spoiled I am

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:56.236 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And they're right!

00:03:56.236 --> 00:03:56.836 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Mmm.

00:03:56.836 --> 00:03:58.404 line:92%
But, really, there's a lot

00:03:58.404 --> 00:03:59.872 line:92%
of Black and Brown people I love

00:03:59.872 --> 00:04:03.576 align:start size:94% position:6%
who have been at work every da
since this thing started

00:04:03.576 --> 00:04:05.745 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
and, real talk,

00:04:05.745 --> 00:04:08.281 align:start size:94% position:6%
I am losing sleep,
terrified for them.

00:04:08.281 --> 00:04:11.284 align:start size:94% position:6%
I wanna come on the show,
doing a silly sketch

00:04:11.284 --> 00:04:12.418 line:92%
where I'm dressed as a doughnut,

00:04:12.418 --> 00:04:13.853 align:start size:94% position:6%
talking about
"Amber ate my family,"

00:04:13.853 --> 00:04:15.588 align:start size:94% position:6%
but, instead,
I gotta be doing this

00:04:15.588 --> 00:04:18.358
because I'm a human being
and I live in this world

00:04:18.358 --> 00:04:20.193 line:92%
and I wanna, in some tiny way,

00:04:20.193 --> 00:04:22.095 align:start size:94% position:6%
try and undo the danger
you put us all in

00:04:22.095 --> 00:04:25.098
when you talk like a friggin
idiot on national television

00:04:25.098 --> 00:04:27.800 align:start size:94% position:6%
This has been
"Amber's Minute of Fury"!

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:32.338 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

